    {
      "type": "text",
      "transparent": false,
      "repeatDirection": "h",
      "title": "How this stack works",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Alloy collects everything for this project only and writes to Prometheus and Loki. Alerts are Prometheus/Loki rules (promtool-tested) delivered by Alertmanager to Discord; the always-firing **Watchdog** pings healthchecks.io, which e-mails if the pings stop. Config lives in `deployment/monitoring/`; validate with `bash deployment/monitoring/validate.sh`."
      },
      "gridPos": {
